// Granted by Heroes/Brute's JuggernautStackDamageSkillAction - while equipped,
// JuggernautSkillData.End adds DamagePerUnit * JuggernautCharge.UnitsHit on top of
// JuggernautEndExplosionUpgrade's own Damage before the End Explosion fires - see
// JuggernautSkillData.ResolveStackDamageBonus. Only has any effect if JuggernautEndExplosionUpgrade
// is also equipped (nothing to scale otherwise - there's no explosion to bonus).
//
// Begin-only, deliberately not paired with End - same reasoning as every other "configures what the
// skill does" upgrade this session: re-granting fresh (idempotent) every activation and never
// removing it means it's simply always there once picked, with nothing to race against.
component JuggernautStackDamageUpgrade
{
    FP DamagePerUnit;
}
